module bankr-kye-local-rules.local-rules

import core.frbp9006.{ frbp9006 }
import frbp.events.{ PetitionFiled }

// The Bankr. E.D. Ky. court's own periods, counted under FRBP 9006(a), the
// FRCP 6(a) method: the Local Rules effective December 1, 2024. The FRBP
// periods (schedules, claims, the chapter 13 plan, discharge,
// dischargeability, the adversary answer, appeals) are lit/frbp's and are
// not declared again. Stated in the rules but not declared: the business-
// day and clock-time periods (U.S. Trustee contact 48 hours before a first-
// day petition, KYEB LBR 2081-3(c); service of a first-day order within 2
// business days, 2081-3(e)); the later-of period for employing a
// professional on notice (the longer of 21 days after the petition or 14
// days after the application, 2014-1); deadlines that are another date
// itself (the chapter 11 bar date for unscheduled and disputed claims is
// the first date set for the disclosure statement hearing, 3003-1; the
// chapter 7 amended deficiency claim deadline is the last date for
// objecting to the trustee's fee application, 3009-1); the plan
// modification that must be filed and served 'more than 7 days' before the
// confirmation hearing (3015-2(b)), whose counting the rules do not state;
// the statutory 45-day chapter 12 confirmation hearing (3090(a), 11 U.S.C.
// § 1224); the recurring six-month progress reports after the first
// (3071-1); and the caps and conditions (four monthly fee installments,
// 1006-1; 60 days of payment advices, 1007-1(c)).

/// The debtor serves the amendment correcting a Statement About Your Social
/// Security Numbers on the parties served with the notice of the case (KYEB
/// LBR 1009-1(d)).
event CorrectedSsnStatementServed()
/// A hearing on a motion, objection, application or other request for
/// relief is scheduled to be held (KYEB LBR 2002-1(a), 9014-1(b)).
event HearingScheduled()
/// A motion for an examination under FRBP 2004 is filed (KYEB LBR 2004-1).
event ExaminationMotionFiled()
/// A chapter 7 trustee submits to the U.S. Trustee the proposed interim
/// distribution motion and its supporting forms (KYEB LBR 2015-1(c)).
event InterimDistributionPackageSubmitted()
/// A chapter 7 trustee files a motion to make an interim distribution (KYEB
/// LBR 2015-1(c)).
event InterimDistributionMotionFiled()
/// An application for compensation or reimbursement of $1,000 or less is
/// served on the limited service list (KYEB LBR 2016-1(c)).
event SmallFeeApplicationServed()
/// An order dismissing a chapter 13 case before confirmation of a plan is
/// entered (KYEB LBR 2016-2(f)).
event PreConfirmationDismissalEntered()
/// An attorney commences representation of the debtor after the petition is
/// filed (KYEB LBR 2016-3).
event RepresentationCommenced()
/// An attorney currently under discipline by any court becomes involved in
/// a case or adversary proceeding before the court (KYEB LBR 2090-2).
event BecameInvolvedInCase()
/// An attorney is sanctioned or disciplined while a matter is pending
/// before the court (KYEB LBR 2090-2).
event AttorneySanctioned()
/// A modified chapter 13 plan is filed (KYEB LBR 3015-3(a)).
event ModifiedPlanFiled()
/// An order on a secured creditor's proposed pre-confirmation adequate
/// protection payments (Local Form 3015-4(c)) is entered (KYEB LBR
/// 3015-4(c)).
event AdequateProtectionOrderEntered()
/// The hearing on approval of a chapter 11 disclosure statement is
/// scheduled to be held (KYEB LBR 3017-1(b)).
event DisclosureHearingScheduled()
/// The hearing on confirmation of a chapter 9 or chapter 11 plan is
/// scheduled to be held (KYEB LBR 3018-2, 3020-1).
event ConfirmationHearingScheduled()
/// The order confirming a chapter 11 plan is entered (KYEB LBR 3071-1).
event Chapter11ConfirmationOrderEntered()
/// The meeting of creditors, as originally noticed or as continued,
/// concludes (KYEB LBR 4001-1(d)).
event MeetingConcluded()
/// In a chapter 13 case, an order or notice of default terminating the stay
/// as to a claim secured by personal property that the trustee pays under
/// the plan is entered (KYEB LBR 4001-1(f)(i)).
event PersonalPropertyStayTerminated()
/// In a chapter 13 case, an order or notice of default terminating the stay
/// as to a claim secured by real property is entered (KYEB LBR
/// 4001-1(f)(ii)).
event RealPropertyStayTerminated()
/// An individual chapter 11 debtor files the Certification of Plan
/// Completion and Request for Discharge (KYEB LBR 4004-3(b)).
event Chapter11DischargeCertificationFiled()
/// The chapter 12 trustee serves the notice of plan completion and of the
/// debtor's need to request a discharge (KYEB LBR 4004-4(a)).
event Chapter12CompletionNoticeServed()
/// A chapter 12 debtor files the Certification of Plan Completion and
/// Request for Discharge (KYEB LBR 4004-4(c)).
event Chapter12DischargeCertificationFiled()
/// The chapter 13 trustee serves the notice of plan completion and of the
/// debtor's need to request a discharge (KYEB LBR 4004-5(a)).
event Chapter13CompletionNoticeServed()
/// A chapter 13 debtor files the Certification of Plan Completion and
/// Request for Discharge (KYEB LBR 4004-5(c)).
event Chapter13DischargeCertificationFiled()
/// A custodian transfers possession of property of the estate (KYEB LBR
/// 6002-1).
event CustodianPossessionTransferred()
/// An order or judgment that the tendering party must serve other than by
/// the ECF System is entered (KYEB LBR 9022-1(b)).
event OrderEntered()
/// A hearing or trial at which an exhibit not filed beforehand is admitted
/// into evidence is held (KYEB LBR 9070-1(b)).
event ExhibitHearingHeld()

/// KYEB LBR 1007-1(c)(ii): copies of the payment advices the debtor
/// received within 60 days before the petition are provided, not filed, to
/// the trustee (and, except in chapter 13, the U.S. Trustee) and to any
/// creditor that timely requests them, within 14 days of the filing of the
/// petition.
deadline payment-advices-period: 14.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 1007-1(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 1009-1(d): within 7 days of serving the amendment correcting
/// the debtor's social security number, the debtor files a certificate of
/// service.
deadline corrected-ssn-certificate-period: 7.days after CorrectedSsnStatementServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 1009-1(d)"

/// KYEB LBR 2002-1(a): unless the Code, an FRBP or KYEB LBR 9013-1(c)
/// provides otherwise, each party served is given at least 14 days notice
/// of a deadline or hearing date, shown by the certificate of service.
deadline hearing-notice-period: 14.days before HearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2002-1(a)"

/// KYEB LBR 2004-1: an order on a motion for a Rule 2004 examination may be
/// entered without a hearing unless an objection is filed within 3 days
/// after the motion is filed.
deadline examination-objection-period: 3.days after ExaminationMotionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2004-1"

/// KYEB LBR 2015-1(c): the chapter 7 trustee allows the U.S. Trustee at
/// least 14 days to review the submissions before filing the motion to make
/// an interim distribution.
deadline interim-distribution-review-period: 14.days after InterimDistributionPackageSubmitted() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2015-1(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 2015-1(c): within 14 days of the trustee's filing of a motion
/// to make an interim distribution, the U.S. Trustee files a statement of
/// no objection or an objection.
deadline interim-distribution-statement-period: 14.days after InterimDistributionMotionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2015-1(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 2016-1(c): an application for compensation or reimbursement of
/// $1,000 or less may be served on the debtor, debtor's counsel, the
/// trustee and any committee on 14 days notice.
deadline small-fee-notice-period: 14.days after SmallFeeApplicationServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2016-1(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 2016-2(a)(ii): to take the presumptively reasonable chapter 13
/// fee, counsel for the debtor files the Certification of Local Form
/// 2016-2(a)(ii) within 14 days of the filing of the petition.
deadline chapter13-fee-certification-period: 14.days after PetitionFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2016-2(a)"

/// KYEB LBR 2016-2(f): an attorney seeking compensation in a chapter 13
/// case dismissed before confirmation may file an itemized application
/// within 14 days after entry of the order of dismissal.
deadline dismissed-case-fee-application-period: 14.days after PreConfirmationDismissalEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2016-2(f)"

/// KYEB LBR 2016-3: an attorney who commences representation of the debtor
/// after the petition files the FRBP 2016(b) statement no later than 14
/// days after commencing representation.
deadline later-counsel-disclosure-period: 14.days after RepresentationCommenced() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2016-3"

/// KYEB LBR 2090-2: an attorney under discipline by any court notifies the
/// Clerk of the sanction within 7 days after becoming involved in a case or
/// adversary proceeding before the court.
deadline discipline-notice-period: 7.days after BecameInvolvedInCase() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2090-2"

/// KYEB LBR 2090-2: an attorney sanctioned during a matter pending before
/// the court notifies the Clerk within 7 days after being sanctioned or
/// disciplined.
deadline sanction-notice-period: 7.days after AttorneySanctioned() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 2090-2"

/// KYEB LBR 3015-3(a)(i): an objection to a modified chapter 13 plan is
/// filed within 7 days after the modified plan is filed (a domestic support
/// creditor's § 1325(a)(8) objection may be filed any time before
/// confirmation, 3015-3(a)(ii)).
deadline modified-plan-objection-period: 7.days after ModifiedPlanFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3015-3(a)"

/// KYEB LBR 3015-4(c): within 7 days of entry of the signed adequate
/// protection order, the secured creditor serves it on all parties in
/// interest and files a certificate of service.
deadline adequate-protection-order-service-period: 7.days after AdequateProtectionOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3015-4(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 3017-1(b): the order setting the disclosure statement hearing
/// fixes the deadline for objections, which ordinarily is 7 days before the
/// hearing.
deadline disclosure-objection-period: 7.days before DisclosureHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3017-1(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 3018-2: the plan proponent files a summary of the voting
/// results, including votes not counted, on or before 5 days before the
/// confirmation hearing.
deadline ballot-summary-period: 5.days before ConfirmationHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3018-2"

/// KYEB LBR 3020-1(b): the Hearing Order fixes the deadline for objections
/// to confirmation, which ordinarily is 7 days before the confirmation
/// hearing.
deadline confirmation-objection-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3020-1(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 3020-1(c): the Hearing Order fixes the time for holders of
/// claims or interests to accept or reject the plan, which ordinarily is 7
/// days before the confirmation hearing.
deadline ballot-period: 7.days before ConfirmationHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3020-1(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 3071-1: unless the court orders otherwise, the proponent of a
/// confirmed chapter 11 plan files a progress report within 45 days after
/// entry of the confirmation order (and every 6 months thereafter until the
/// final decree).
deadline progress-report-period: 45.days after Chapter11ConfirmationOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 3071-1"

/// KYEB LBR 4001-1(d): where the objection deadline in a combined stay-
/// relief and abandonment motion expires before the meeting of creditors,
/// the trustee has 14 days from the conclusion of the meeting to object to
/// abandonment; the property is deemed abandoned on the 15th day.
deadline abandonment-objection-period: 14.days after MeetingConcluded() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4001-1(d)"

/// KYEB LBR 4001-1(f)(i): a chapter 13 creditor whose claim secured by
/// personal property is paid under the plan has 90 days from the order or
/// notice of default terminating the stay, unless extended, to file an
/// amended claim for the unpaid balance.
deadline personal-property-amended-claim-period: 90.days after PersonalPropertyStayTerminated() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4001-1(f)"

/// KYEB LBR 4001-1(f)(ii): a chapter 13 creditor whose claim is secured by
/// real property has 210 days from the order or notice of default
/// terminating the stay, unless extended, to file an amended claim for the
/// unpaid balance.
deadline real-property-amended-claim-period: 210.days after RealPropertyStayTerminated() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4001-1(f)"

/// KYEB LBR 4004-3(b): a response to an individual chapter 11 debtor's
/// Certification of Plan Completion and Request for Discharge is filed
/// within 14 days after the certification is filed.
deadline chapter11-discharge-response-period: 14.days after Chapter11DischargeCertificationFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4004-3(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 4004-4(b): a chapter 12 debtor files the Certification of Plan
/// Completion and Request for Discharge within 30 days of the trustee's
/// notice of plan completion.
deadline chapter12-discharge-certification-period: 30.days after Chapter12CompletionNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4004-4(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 4004-4(c): a response to a chapter 12 debtor's certification
/// and request for discharge is filed within 14 days after the
/// certification is filed.
deadline chapter12-discharge-response-period: 14.days after Chapter12DischargeCertificationFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4004-4(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 4004-5(b): a chapter 13 debtor files the Certification of Plan
/// Completion and Request for Discharge within 30 days of the trustee's
/// notice of plan completion.
deadline chapter13-discharge-certification-period: 30.days after Chapter13CompletionNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4004-5(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 4004-5(c): a response to a chapter 13 debtor's certification
/// and request for discharge is filed within 14 days after the
/// certification is filed.
deadline chapter13-discharge-response-period: 14.days after Chapter13DischargeCertificationFiled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 4004-5(c)"

/// KYEB LBR 6002-1: unless otherwise ordered, the custodian's FRBP 6002
/// report and account is filed within 30 days of transfer of possession of
/// the property.
deadline custodian-report-period: 30.days after CustodianPossessionTransferred() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 6002-1"

/// KYEB LBR 9014-1(b): an objection or response to a matter noticed for
/// hearing is filed not less than 3 days before the scheduled hearing
/// unless the court orders otherwise.
deadline hearing-response-period: 3.days before HearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 9014-1(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 9022-1(b): the party responsible for serving an order or
/// judgment other than by the ECF System files a certificate of service
/// within 7 days of its entry.
deadline order-service-certificate-period: 7.days after OrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 9022-1(b)"

/// KYEB LBR 9070-1(b): an exhibit admitted at a hearing or trial that was
/// not filed electronically beforehand is filed electronically within 3
/// days after the hearing or trial.
deadline admitted-exhibit-filing-period: 3.days after ExhibitHearingHeld() counted_by frbp9006 cite "KYEB LBR 9070-1(b)"
